+  <meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
+  <meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; script-src 'none'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self'; font-src 'none'; connect-src 'none'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; worker-src 'none'; manifest-src 'none'">
+  <title>Privacy | The Daily Grind</title>
+  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/styles.css">
+</head>
+<body>
+  <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
+    <a class="logo" href="/">THE DAILY GRIND</a>
+    <a href="/">Back to home</a>
+  </nav>
+  <main class="container privacy-notice">
+    <h1>Your privacy at The Daily Grind</h1>
+    <p>Updated November 2, 2026. This notice covers this static coffee website. It does not describe a separate ordering, rewards, or account service.</p>
+    <h2>Only what is needed to show this site</h2>
+    <p>These pages do not ask for personal information or use analytics, advertising trackers, cookies, browser storage, fingerprinting, or client-side scripts. There are no forms or background data submissions.</p>
+    <h2>Images and other services</h2>
+    <p>Our images and styles are served from this website. Viewing these pages does not load third-party fonts, images, maps, videos, or tracking services. The coffee photograph was sourced from Unsplash and is hosted locally.</p>
+    <h2>Hosting and connection data</h2>
+    <p>Your browser sends connection information, including your IP address and browser request headers, to the hosting provider to retrieve these pages. The provider may process access and security logs. Its logging settings, retention, and access controls are managed separately from this website; this code does not set a retention period for those logs.</p>
+    <h2>Your choices</h2>
+    <p>You can browse without providing account information or enabling optional tracking. There is no optional tracking to accept and no site-created browser data to clear. Navigation to a separate service may be governed by that service’s privacy notice.</p>
+    <h2>Questions</h2>
+    <p>For privacy questions, please speak with The Daily Grind team at a café. Please avoid sharing passwords, payment information, or other sensitive details.</p>
+  </main>
+  <footer><a href="/">The Daily Grind home</a></footer>
+</body>
+</html>
